  "_born": "灵根 from the 生辰 (rules/roots.mjs): the three pillars — year (turning at 立春), month (turning at each month's 节) and day — give six characters, each an element. A lone element on the year branch is the family's, not the player's, and is dropped; one element four times or more crowds out every lone one. What is left are the roots, the most first. Measured over every birthday 1950–2015: 天 7.0% · 地 7.2% · 真 44.1% · 伪 41.7%. Skipped, the same reckoning runs on a day drawn by the save's start. The birthday is never kept.",
  "_fate": "命格 — a lifelong base tone beside the 灵根, set once and only if the player wishes: 生肖 from the birth year, turning at 立春 (by the day — no hour is asked), and 日主, the day's heavenly stem, whose element the player is at home in. `zodiac` from 甲子 1984 (rat); `stems` in order, a day's stem is (JDN + 9) mod 10; `lichun` is the February day of 立春 for each year from `from` (checked against lunar-python). The birthday itself is never kept.",
